+  Each starter evolves at levels 16 and 32, has complete battle/follower art,
+  a shiny palette, Pokédex data, cries, egg moves, teachables, and level-up
+  attacks through the three-region endgame.
+- Gary now takes the physical ball containing the counter family: Joeyro
+  counters Psyshell, Psyshell counters Amphid, and Amphid counters Joeyro.
+- The two unchosen starters remain obtainable later. Erika entrusts Psyshell
+  after the Rainbow Badge, Amphid waits in Seafoam Islands' hidden spring,
+  and Joeyro trains beside Mt. Ember after the Volcano Badge.
+- The original trio moved into the world: rare Bulbasaur in Safari Zone North,
+  Cyndaquil in Burned Tower B1F, and Mudkip on Route 119.
+- Added **Fintom → Hauntide → Sharkraith**, a Water/Ghost shark family found
+  in the Abandoned Ship's hidden flooded corridors. It evolves at levels 24
+  and 44, ending as a powerful walking shark whose limbs remain spectral.
+
